ceptibility and robustness. Through well-connected fitness function with peak signal-to-noise ratio and normalized cross-correlation coefficient, the watermark sequence encrypted by two-dimensional chaotic stream encryption from a meaningful image is embedded into the DCT coefficients of host image through getting an optimal intensity by genetic algorithm. Synergetic neural network, offering a new and different approach to the construction of highly parallel structures for pattern recognition, is used in watermark identification to identify the extracted watermark and has the ability to recognize the original watermark quickly and accurately after attacks. The experimental results prove the validity of the optimal image watermark proposed in this paper.","authors":[{"id":"a5100611594","name":"Yongqiang Chen","orcid":"0000-0003-2485-3529","institution_ids":["i37461747","i43922553"]},{"id":"a5112117306","name":"Peng Lihua","orcid":"","institution_ids":["i37461747","i43922553"]}],"institution_ids":["i37461747","i43922553"],"venue":null,"task_tags":["digital_watermarking"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1109/icicta.2009.517","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2128740525","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icicta.2009.517","citation_count":9,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2128740525","url":"https://openalex.org/W2128740525","query":"neural image watermarking","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T03:56:55Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.1109/icicta.2009.517","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icicta.2009.517","query":"image provenance watermark verification","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T07:32:47Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：具有稳定来源，且任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-c2f29784680dc27a","title":"A robust block-based image watermarking scheme using fast Hadamard transform and singular value decomposition","title_zh":"","year":2006,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"author-460ee4e33077a8","name":"E.E. Ab